<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Johnson Controls started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Johnson Controls started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said analyst Melissa Reilly initiated coverage of Johnson Controls Inc with an outperform rating.</p>
<p>-- shares fell 3/8 to 37-3/4.</p>
<p>-- analyst not immediately available.</p>
</text>
